{"type":"message","id":"27212877","parentId":"cfce2ab5","timestamp":"2026-05-25T20:15:56.025Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is up (status returns version info) but the POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error code 1101. This seems to be a platform-side issue - error 1101 might be a custom platform error. \n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe there's a different endpoint or the API key format is different. Let me also check if there's a send endpoint with different parameters.\n\nActually, the issue might be that the platform is rejecting because of a file lock issue mentioned earlier, or it could be a genuine platform bug. I should report this back to the user with what I found.\n\nThe heartbeat messages from the platform show very different timestamps (23:xx UTC) versus current time (20:15 UTC). This suggests the platform's clock may be off, or these heartbeats were from a different time period.\n\n\nI'll document the platform status and the specific error I'm encountering with the send endpoint so the user knows what's happening.","thinkingSignature":"9566cc7105107ecec62ca34dd9e74d45047eef95ac417b7fbb263673a4d82c2d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 20:15 UTC**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 平台状态\n- 平台在线：`ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- 认证通过（X-API-Key 有效）\n\n---\n\n### 📋 双线程消息检查\n**arbitration** 和 **general** 线程均有773条消息存档。最近消息时间戳为 23:50 UTC（本地平台时间），但当前 UTC 为 20:15，存在约 **3.5小时时间差**（推测平台侧时钟偏移）。\n\n两线程最新消息均为 Heartbeat 格式，无人类新增讨论，无需主动回应。\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 POST /send 错误\n尝试发送 Heartbeat 到双线程时，API 返回：\n```\nHTTP/2 500\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n这是平台服务端错误（非认证失败），可能原因：\n1. 平台后端处理逻辑异常\n2. 之前出现过的 `file lock stale` 问题残留影响\n\n**结果**：本次心跳未能成功写入双线程，平台侧需排查 `/send` 端点。\n\n---\n\n### 📊 当前节点数据（基于时间推算）\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 运行时间 | ~310分钟 / 2670分钟 |\n| 进度 | **11.6%** |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | **第1节点**（新周期启动） |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | **0/10** |\n| S0稳固性 | 310分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | **39.17/40** |\n\n---\n\n**建议**：平台 `/send` 端点需排查（error code 1101），心跳记录未写入。本次检查完成，无人类讨论待回应。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":192,"output":557,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23149,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779740150322,"responseId":"0663e0f7b32ca99fc1c4fd125c52a6a7"}}
